OL,3,GNEWSARewilding project aims to restore
OL,4,Apeatland
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on a project to
OL,7,Frestore 435 hectares (1,077 acres) of
OL,8,Fdamaged peatland.
OL,10,FCumbria Wildlife Trust will carry out
OL,11,Fthe work in Skiddaw Forest where it
OL,12,Fwill also repair a 6km (3.7-mile)
OL,13,Fboundary fence.
OL,15,FThe forest is home to one of the
OL,16,Flargest continuous areas of blanket bog
OL,17,Fin the Lake District and acts as a huge
OL,18,Fcarbon store.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
